1997, â€™The Hipparcos and Tycho Cataloguesâ€™, ESA SP-1200, Volume 1,
Section 1.5.3, for the conversion details.</DESCRIPTION>
</FIELD>
<FIELD datatype="double" name="b" ucd="pos.galactic.lat" unit="Angle[deg]">
